msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫……또……."

#: search:search_913C6C5B_DE65_459D_8148_136B8DAAABE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f551750cf284b5dc5a2b89b83c2b2d65999c7261eed14b194c7ab8a2d732e47b
