msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……너는 나를 기다린다고 했지……."

#: search:search_B320244E_8E13_4AA2_8770_DAFE48335C47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3713cd9045bb36f5d549162fa89cd2060d6aac9c5db27dba521f98b3ce6ae6cc
#. default-sha256: 063f9f4cf849cb37f753e0b111f6ea80902b6cf05698583904ae94435b799143
msgctxt "search:search_B320244E_8E13_4AA2_8770_DAFE48335C47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I did, indeed, say that when you first arrived.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I have been waiting for "
"your return for a very long time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫네, ⟪k:3⟫맨 처음에 말씀드렸다시피 ⟪k:4⟫저는 주인님을 오래도록 기다렸답니다. ⟪k:5⟫아"
"주 오래도록……."

#: search:search_140202FB_9473_4BAF_BFD0_E32CA5DCC3E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eda7958e6bcc5214d77287bb718134cf0d3ba3be13a6494063ca0ee192f15a7b
#. default-sha256: da06c2b431867e336dee502465ad5f6141710007b21e4f9bedb0460e665a5d0c
msgctxt "search:search_140202FB_9473_4BAF_BFD0_E32CA5DCC3E3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...That would make me a ghost, then, you say?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫자그마치 ⟪k:1⟫수백 년 단위일 수도 있겠군요.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫……어머, ⟪k:5⟫그러면 제가 ⟪k:6⟫유령"
"이냐고요?"

