#: search:search_E72785FD_5854_43DD_B8DA_45D0F2A1512F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9fb7e5f9a9fc4be1e6924e79ffbc3e1d92def6086370b0234975af16d9e9c09
#. default-sha256: 589798ea19e8ce76945908a06d72c1b0324cd4a5bdb4721978a2c1adfb1e965d
