msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hehehe... ⟪k:3⟫I am very much not a ghost.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Would I be able to hold your "
"hand if I were?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫우후후……. ⟪k:3⟫그렇지 않답니다.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫유령이라면 ⟪k:6⟫손을 못 잡지 않겠는지요?"

#: search:search_7860D620_E190_48D4_80A9_0805BEAEAB0E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6c18016830d41cb280857c8231c8eda7a6c19d3aca0b926101363b9e15c37987
#. default-sha256: 6b137f941477c681881f06855a61d926b915140e6a9c7bdada7df09ccc1572a2
msgctxt "search:search_7860D620_E190_48D4_80A9_0805BEAEAB0E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Saying this, the Maid took ⟪k:1⟫Your⟪k:2⟫the Departed’s⟪k:3⟫ hand.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫It was cold "
"enough to send a shudder down ⟪k:6⟫Your⟪k:7⟫his⟪k:8⟫ spine—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫and completely devoid "
"of life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫시녀는 그 말을 하며 ⟪k:1⟫다시 ⟪k:2⟫「당신」⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫「죽은 자」⟪k:5⟫의 손을 잡았다.⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫역시 소름이 돋을 만큼 차가운 게, ⟪k:8⟫생기가 전혀 느껴지지 않았다."

#: search:search_878F0081_8437_4841_BF7E_8563EAA5D849
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40cc99a8c968531399ef165af86f22cd1eafdea46ca23635fb30ac6dc37f437b
#. default-sha256: 7081030936adce2f0b0fb3efc1e0d871cdc5ddc549466732c7e19de93c754e53
msgctxt "search:search_878F0081_8437_4841_BF7E_8563EAA5D849"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though, as chilling as it may have been,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You⟪k:3⟫he⟪k:4⟫ still took comfort in the "
"feeling of her hand in ⟪k:5⟫Yours⟪k:6⟫his⟪k:7⟫."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……그래도, ⟪k:1⟫이토록 차가운 손이라도⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫잡고 있으니 마음이 놓였다."

