msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫(잡을 수 있는 거 아닐까……)"

#: search:search_BE70A293_14BB_44D3_B717_34A0A7CB01F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e342198ea3d4b425d4b76d708b2dbfadaeedbffe8e321fffe7b63233f7246408
