#: search:search_3784042F_9D7B_4CE0_9C70_8140BD6B0EE6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 854f2acbc018066888e3f1c531d499ad52da06eddc3c49ac29e3a72047f7d999
