msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A dreadful, deep-rooted curse afflicts this mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫이 저택은 저주받았습니다.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫아주 ⟪k:5⟫깊이, ⟪k:6⟫뿌리 깊게 박힌 ⟪k:7⟫무시무"
